  "sourceDiscrepancies": [
    "MiraeN teacher PDF 299 and older NASA Witch Head page say Orion; official IAU coordinate lookup and ESO place IC 2118 in Eridanus. App uses Eridanus.",
    "Sesame NGC6888 resolves WR136 central star; its coordinates are a reference center, not a nebula type classification. NASA Caldwell metadata calls it planetary while its own physical discussion describes a massive Wolf-Rayet wind nebula; classify as emission nebula, not planetary.",
    "Downloaded bound_20.dat rows are globally ordered by RA, contrary to traversal documentation. Do not connect this row order. Original ordered B1875 file is used instead."
  ],
